{"overview":"تسونا، دانش‌آموز دبیرستانی خجالتی، در مدرسه، ورزش و زندگی اجتماعی شکست‌خورده است. اما همه چیز اطراف تسونا کاملاً تغییر می‌کند وقتی نوزادی به نام ریبرن، که ادعا می‌کند یک قاتل ایتالیایی از خانواده وونگولا است، ظاهر می‌شود! ریبرن برای تربیت تسونا به عنوان رئیس آینده‌ی خانواده‌ی مافیا فرستاده شده است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Tsuna, a timid junior high student, is a failure at school, sports, and social life. But everything around Tsuna has been completely changed when a baby called Reborn, who claims to be an Italian hit man from Vongola family shows up! Reborn was sent to groom Tsuna for his future life as a mafia boss of the family!","tagline_en":"","runtime":25,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":7,"y":2010,"poster":"/gLdtMljsgyAJmqonkN2shm7bL9Z.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":33,"y":2006,"poster":"/6x7mx9f3ufHCC3pNgMoMnzVo3jw.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":32,"y":2007,"poster":"/cOm4hKIzfw1WmddY9NHbElIWQ0p.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":8,"y":2008,"poster":"/unP2KGOxoS0MAzVgPwsACrrxx5u.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":68,"y":2009,"poster":"/pkHMjerpqFp0isZYC12ICQalDt9.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":13,"y":2009,"poster":"/yIREK5KPvNjYgSybxtsOkasuwch.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":23,"y":2009,"poster":"/nnCq2Bvf7R98BgHqTVacMy2a3o8.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":12,"y":2010,"poster":"/l5dzOMxtRYRZthtsvJRTS3zOAJ6.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":14,"y":2010,"poster":"/rF53SLKb8UtUdrnqlD7dIObNC3.jpg"}],"episodes":203,"crew":["今泉賢一"],"crew_en":["Kenichi Imaizumi"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"國分優香里","role":"Tsunayoshi Sawada (voice)","photo":"/62oCBhq366fTpsOojdOW01QGs75.jpg","en":"Yukari Kokubun"},{"name":"ニーコ","role":"Reborn (voice)","photo":"/pSZhnghRr7k8WOiOUaCCGyorzWg.jpg","en":"NEEKO"},{"name":"近藤隆","role":"Kyoya Hibari (voice)","photo":"/9KRXSp1m4fofxJKtoEzsYFnai46.jpg","en":"Takashi Kondo"},{"name":"Toshinobu Iida","role":"Mukuro Rokudo (voice)","photo":"/ycMjrKbKrP7FDlvI0GBpcZ8iOq7.jpg"},{"name":"津田健次郎","r